{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/pulls/3203","id":2770775244,"node_id":"PR_kwDONIZfbs6lJqzM","html_url":"https://github.com/verl-project/verl/pull/3203","diff_url":"https://github.com/verl-project/verl/pull/3203.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/verl-project/verl/pull/3203.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/issues/3203","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/pulls/3203/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/pulls/3203/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/issues/3203/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/verl-project/verl/statuses/016cbd750c556b6307ad2a9105229e031c3933a0","number":3203,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[megatron,recipe] feat: support Qwen3-30B (MoE) DAPO training on ASCEND NPU","user":{"login":"wlf-darkmatter","id":62014693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMDE0Njkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62014693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter","html_url":"https://github.com/wlf-darkmatter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wlf-darkmatter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### What does this PR do?\r\n\r\nFix of megatron config, and example shell of Qwen3-30B-Dapo with megatron.\r\n\r\n### Checklist Before Starting\r\n\r\n- [x] Search for similar PRs. Paste at least one query link here: ...\r\n- [x] Format the PR title as `[{modules}] {type}: {description}` (This will be checked by the CI)\r\n  - `{modules}` include `fsdp`, `megatron`, `sglang`, `vllm`, `rollout`, `trainer`, `ci`, `training_utils`, `recipe`, `hardware`, `deployment`, `ray`, `worker`, `single_controller`, `misc`, `perf`, `model`, `algo`, `env`, `tool`, `ckpt`, `doc`, `data`\r\n  - If this PR involves multiple modules, separate them with `,` like `[megatron, fsdp, doc]`\r\n  - `{type}` is in `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `chore`, `test`\r\n  - If this PR breaks any API (CLI arguments, config, function signature, etc.), add `[BREAKING]` to the beginning of the title.\r\n  - Example: `[BREAKING][fsdp, megatron] feat: dynamic batching`\r\n\r\n### Test\r\n\r\ncritic/reward/mean:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1304\" height=\"704\" alt=\"dapo_30b_megatron\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2062e24-b37d-4d54-8dd6-e9da25f8c69b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nresponse_length/mean:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"815\" height=\"407\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f59b6c7b-4f24-4aa7-9b9e-bb8184dac5d3\" />\r\n\r\n### Checklist Before Submitting\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> Please check all the following items before requesting a review, otherwise the reviewer might deprioritize this PR for review.\r\n\r\n- [x] Read the [Contribute Guide](https://github.com/volcengine/verl/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\r\n- [x] Apply [pre-commit checks](https://github.com/volcengine/verl/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-linting-and-formatting): `pre-commit install && pre-commit run --all-files --show-diff-on-failure --color=always`\r\n- [x] Add / Update [the documentation](https://github.com/volcengine/verl/tree/main/docs).\r\n- [x] Add unit or end-to-end test(s) to [the CI workflow](https://github.com/volcengine/verl/tree/main/.github/workflows) to cover all the code. If not feasible, explain why: ...\r\n- [ ] Once your PR is ready for CI, send a message in [the `ci-request` channel](https://verl-project.slack.com/archives/C091TCESWB1) in [the `verl` Slack workspace](https://join.slack.com/t/verl-project/shared_invite/zt-3855yhg8g-CTkqXu~hKojPCmo7k_yXTQ). (If not accessible, please try [the Feishu group (飞书群)](https://applink.larkoffice.com/client/chat/chatter/add_by_link?link_token=772jd4f1-cd91-441e-a820-498c6614126a).)\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-25T06:43:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T11:08:23Z","closed_at":"2025-09-13T11:08:23Z","merged_at":"2025-09-13T11:08:23Z","merge_commit_sha":"b00b090149a23dc04e7d98afae15691790481894","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"chenhaiq","id":4373761,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzM3NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4373761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq","html_url":"https://github.com/chenhaiq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chenhaiq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"eric-haibin-lin","id":5545640,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NDU2NDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5545640?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eric-haibin-lin","ht